<title>USA: FBR Capital Corp FY96 net $0.06 shr.</title>
<headline>FBR Capital Corp FY96 net $0.06 shr.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>FBR Capital Corp, formerly known as Richard Barrie Fragrances Inc, on Tuesday reported net losses of $4,828,165 from discontinued operations for the fiscal year ended June 30.</p>
<p>As a result of a gain on asset disposal and discharge of debt, net income was $267,827, or $0.06 per share, for the fiscal year, the company said.</p>
<p>The company sold virtually all assets to Parlux Fragrances Inc on June 28. The company has no continuing operations and is seeking a business combination with another as yet undetermined company.</p>
</text>
